{"id":57457,"ord":46,"n_segments":182,"prev":57456,"next":57458,"doc":{"id":"68239","title":"68239_Ram Ramirez oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Ram Ramirez","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68239/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68239"},"chapter":"52nd Street and Willie Bryant","title":"Willie Bryant as a bandleader","category":"person_portrait","summary":"Willie was a theatre-bred, good-looking, sweet personality who carried the band like Cab Calloway.","period":"1935-36","year_from":1935,"year_to":1935,"words":78,"start":[53,7],"end":[53,14],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68239#s57457","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Willie Bryant Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Willie Bryant"}]},"people":[{"name":"Willie Bryant","qid":"Q730199","n":1},{"name":"Sammy Davis","qid":"Q297816","n":1}],"story":{"theme":18,"theme_name":"Getting paid: wages, tips and leaving over money","community":39,"community_name":"Battling at the Savoy Ballroom","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":53,"b":7,"s":"Q","x":"I mean, it was a good band, but primarily it was carried by Willie's personality, wasn't it? I mean, he was like a Cab Calloway almost."},{"p":53,"b":8,"s":"RAM RAMIREZ","x":"Yeah, exactly."},{"p":53,"b":9,"s":"Q","x":"He was a good-looking guy."},{"p":53,"b":10,"s":"RAM RAMIREZ","x":"Very, yeah."},{"p":53,"b":11,"s":"Q","x":"With his white suits and all that..."},{"p":53,"b":12,"s":"RAM RAMIREZ","x":"Light features and all that. Well, he came up in the theatre, you know, a Sammy Davis type of... But he was a good guy to work with."},{"p":53,"b":13,"s":"Q","x":"Was he?"},{"p":53,"b":14,"s":"RAM RAMIREZ","x":"Yeah. A sort of sweet guy."}]}